<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 08:39:45 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8ab1cf153b1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只3个月大的黄色拉布拉多仰面睡在它的“房间”里。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A 3-month-old yellow labrador sleeping on his back in his "room"' height="1000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/muddyfire/6a8ab1cf153b1.jpg" width="1000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://muddyfire.some.pics"&gt;@muddyfire&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 08:39:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a89f1c352d92</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一瓶柏林米尔德拉格啤酒的绿色玻璃瓶立在木质台面上，旁边放着一个瓶盖。背景中可以看到堆叠的装饰罐和其他食品包装。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A green glass bottle of Berliner Mildes Lager beer stands on a wooden countertop, with a bottle cap nearby. In the background, stacked decorative tins and other food packaging are visible. - Eine grüne Glasflasche Berliner Mildes Lager Bier steht auf einer Holztheke, daneben eine Kronkorke. Im Hintergrund sind gestapelte dekorative Dosen und andere Lebensmittelverpackungen zu sehen." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a89f1c352d92.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a89f17e917da</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个装满柏林淡啤酒瓶的纸板啤酒箱，啤酒独特的棕色和绿色包装 prominently 展示其中。 - Eine blaue Bierkiste gefüllt mit Flaschen Berliner Mildes Lager, wobei die markante braune und grüne Verpackung des Bieres prominent abgebildet ist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A cardboard beer crate filled with bottles of Berliner Mildes Lager, with the beer's distinctive brown and green packaging prominently displayed. - Eine blaue Bierkiste gefüllt mit Flaschen Berliner Mildes Lager, wobei die markante braune und grüne Verpackung des Bieres prominent abgebildet ist." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6a89f17e917da.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:59:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a89ea9f67cf3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;噢，天堂就在人间&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A tall wooden table with tall, white chairs with dark blue cushions stands on a beach. The tabletop is made of glass, and the predominantly blue sky and a few white clouds are reflected in it. In the background, you can see water" height="2424" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a89ea9f67cf3.jpg" width="1818"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:29:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a89cc0c8ca2e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;💃 球道嘉年华&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="💃 Fairway Festival " height="4012" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a89cc0c8ca2e.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 16:19:28 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>